<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.08		 41.13</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	65.95		 66.05</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.95		 24.00</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.336		 0.338</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.96		 10.98</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.19		 11.21</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.60 pct	    2.80 pct</p>
